            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Pādayātra, is the traditional practice of walking long distances as part of a religious or spiritual pursuit. People across religions in our country observe similar forms of pilgrimage or spiritual walking, although they may have different names or purposes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
