            0.281
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Some of the pilgrimages are Ajmer Sharif Dargah Ziyarat, Pandharpur Wari, Kānwar Yatra, Sabarimala Yatra, Sammed Shikharji Yatra, Lumbini to Sarnath Yatra."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
